  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.31 Operator-funded promotion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.31 “Operator-funded promotion” means special offers and prizes funded by the game operator to attract patrons to the facility. Such promotions include, but are not limited to, bonuses, contests, and giveaways.\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.20)",
